OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CSunday:FA bright but chilly morning,   
OL,6,Fwith many seeing some sunshine.        
OL,7,FShowers develop around mid-day, some   
OL,8,Fmay be heavy and blustery at times.    
OL,9,FBrighter and drier spells to follow.   
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWindy 
OL,12,Fwith cloudy periods on Monday,         
OL,13,Fheaviest rain likely to remain over    
OL,14,Fthe Pennines. Wet and windy start to   
OL,15,FTuesday, drier later. Partly cloudy,   
OL,16,Frain affecting southern parts on       
OL,17,FWednesday.                             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
